-<DIV8 N="§ 463.8" TYPE="SECTION">
-<HEAD>§ 463.8   Severability.</HEAD>
-<P>The provisions of this part are separate and severable from one another. If any provision is stayed or determined to be invalid, it is the Commission's intention that the remaining provisions will continue in effect.
-
-
